# Name: New Profiler
#
# Fork of Dimiter Prodanov's Color Profiler (original jar: Color_Profiler.jar).
# Fixes: (1) macro-driven export via run("New Profiler", "save=<path>") with no
# file dialog; (2) x-axis now rescales to the ROI length instead of being
# pinned to the ROI's absolute pixel offset.
#
# Original author: Dimiter Prodanov (D.Prodanov at lumc.nl), University of Leiden
# Original version: 1.2, 12 June 2005; Requires ImageJ 1.31s
# Fork maintainer: local build; changes marked "NewProfiler" in source.
# License: GNU LGPL v2.1-or-later (see License.txt)

Analyze>Tools, "New Profiler", ColorProfiler_
Help>About Plugins, "New Profiler...", ColorProfiler_("about")
